# The flags every tsl route plays with in `kjk chain`, before its header's
# own (`kjk chain --bare` leaves them out): blows that end fights quickly,
# so a route tests what the scripts and the world do, not the fights'
# balance (as k1's chain.flags). The player is the Jedi Exile exile.build
# makes at the prologue's new game and levels by its plan in every route.
--mighty --build data/routes/tsl/exile.build
